    "body": "## Summary\n\nUpdate `bip352_send_and_receive_vectors.json` to match the test vectors in the bitcoin/bips repository at commit `04393c98`.\n\nThis update includes:\n- The corrected input encodings from the BIP 352 vectors (`04393c98`), without changing any expected results.\n- The new Taproot annex test case (`3c68d3f3`), which covers an annex-removal error not caught by the previous vectors in Bitcoin Core's C++ tests.\n\nNo test code has been modified. Only the test vector file has been updated.\n\n## Testing\n\nTested on macOS 27.2.1, Apple M3.\n\n- C++: `bip352_tests` passed.\n- Python: `test_framework.bip352` passed.\n\nBoth test suites were run before and after updating the vectors.\n",
