        "payload": "tree fb44ba4d71878ec6875ae59b4f0b1eab94ec8221\nparent dd96035e031edf56fcf66a09d443f257a346af1f\nauthor Davi de Jesus <davidejesus.log@proton.me> 1795732299 -0300\ncommitter devdavidejesus <davidejesus.log@proton.me> 1795732299 -0300\n\ntest: update BIP352 test vectors\n\nUpdate bip352_send_and_receive_vectors.json to match the test vectors\nin the bitcoin/bips repository at commit 04393c98.\n\nThis update includes:\n- The corrected input encodings from the BIP 352 vectors (04393c98),\n  without changing any expected results.\n- The new Taproot annex test case (3c68d3f3), which covers an\n  annex-removal error not caught by the previous vectors in Bitcoin\n  Core's C++ tests.\n\nNo test code has been modified. Only the test vector file has been\nupdated.\n",
